0190: the wide int8 expert tile's kernel: one work-group a (route tile, 512-column band), 16 sub-groups of 16 lanes, two columns a lane. A 2,304-row expert is 5 bands instead of 18, so a tile's staged block is filled once for 512 columns rather than four times, and a launch's work-groups are 5 of 18. Its own program (mul_mm_kq_i8_wide.cl), built only when GGML_OPENCL_KQ_MM_ID_I8_WIDE asks; unset keeps the narrow tile. Design followed from trellis-serve xpu/csrc/exl3_moe.sycl @8f8e2fcc (MIT), no code copied.

